                            	  3641: SecretArmosXs:
02:00039F22 E0              	  3642:     dc.b    $E0, $B0, $B0, $30, $40, $90, $A0
02:00039F23 B0
02:00039F24 B0
02:00039F25 30
02:00039F26 40
02:00039F27 90
02:00039F28 A0
